{"3775210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rustmourne", "steam_appid": 3775210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Rustmourne</strong> is a Sci-fi Survival Horror with detailed, VR-designed interactions. Traverse the corridors of an ancient, derelict structure, and face the tortured beings in it: <strong>hide</strong>, <strong>run</strong>, or <strong>cut</strong> off their limbs to survive. Will you be able to understand the purpose of your awakening and get out alive?<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/6ad729cf902ae6570aa2f48ff6f9ec2c.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/0c6b3e2125c8b9326a5975f11e9e37de.poster.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/0c6b3e2125c8b9326a5975f11e9e37de.webm?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/0c6b3e2125c8b9326a5975f11e9e37de.mp4?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Crawling abominations stalk the corridors of the megastructure, and being silent can make the difference between life and death. Use sounds to your advantage to open a path forward.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/f69dff2cf9171b065cac8c9ee539a7af.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/514b5f7700d6d30cba557881df417b8f.poster.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/514b5f7700d6d30cba557881df417b8f.webm?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/514b5f7700d6d30cba557881df417b8f.mp4?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Inspired by Dead Space genre-defining enemy design, tailored for a horrific VR experience. Dismember your enemies to slow them, blind them, or cripple them. Every enemy has different behaviours based on how you amputate their limbs… bringing both benefit and risk.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/892b800c88a3e2af139886647c937d21.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/8cb7c3aebe63eb309c0c0de1b476f532.poster.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/8cb7c3aebe63eb309c0c0de1b476f532.webm?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/8cb7c3aebe63eb309c0c0de1b476f532.mp4?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Handle a host of original, custom-made weapons with immersive physicality, designed specifically for VR. Every weapon has a different behavior, reload animation, and way to operate it.  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/0e8f478025a77aaf46acfa5309757a42.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/f058e265586fe671fea9cb5f74575af4.poster.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/f058e265586fe671fea9cb5f74575af4.webm?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/f058e265586fe671fea9cb5f74575af4.mp4?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Guns and ammunition run low in the megastructure, but do not let that hold you back. Take advantage of the environment and your powers to fight creatively and stay alive.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/58f70394d4558a941a65f78b6f6276ae.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/077e326589485b9b81a2b6886c99f453.poster.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/077e326589485b9b81a2b6886c99f453.webm?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/077e326589485b9b81a2b6886c99f453.mp4?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The voice in your head will not let you stay dead for long, but coming back to life has its price. This world, where things rot and renew endlessly, will not let you get used to it.", "about_the_game": "<strong>Rustmourne</strong> is a Sci-fi Survival Horror with detailed, VR-designed interactions. Traverse the corridors of an ancient, derelict structure, and face the tortured beings in it: <strong>hide</strong>, <strong>run</strong>, or <strong>cut</strong> off their limbs to survive. Will you be able to understand the purpose of your awakening and get out alive?<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/6ad729cf902ae6570aa2f48ff6f9ec2c.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/0c6b3e2125c8b9326a5975f11e9e37de.poster.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/0c6b3e2125c8b9326a5975f11e9e37de.webm?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/0c6b3e2125c8b9326a5975f11e9e37de.mp4?t=1787143523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Crawling abominations stalk the corridors of the megastructure, and being silent can make the difference between life and death. Use sounds to your advantage to open a path forward.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/f69dff2cf9171b065cac8c9ee539a7af.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775210/extras/514b5f7700d6d30cba557881df417b8f.poster.avif?t=1787143523\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item